usage: step4_similarity_matrix.py [-h] --experiment-dir EXPERIMENT_DIR
                                  [--month {2,6,10}] [--full-universe]

Compute similarity matrices from linked tables.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --experiment-dir EXPERIMENT_DIR
                        Experiment directory path
  --month {2,6,10}      Optional month filter (2, 6, 10); omit for general
                        matrix
  --full-universe       Build the similarity matrix over all FEWSNET admin
                        codes found in the partition files (legacy behavior).
                        Default is to restrict to the in-scope admin codes
                        derived from the partition files (partition_id !=
                        's-1').
